Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.43,0:02:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.49,0:02:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's here to save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.99,0:02:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile, one of the Seven\NWarlords? Calm down, you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.09,0:02:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,peasants i only came to\Nyour pathetic little town
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.77,0:02:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for that pirate's head\Nhe's so great and modest he
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.31,0:02:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,comes and saves us but he\Nwon't take the credit for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.81,0:02:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three cheers for Crocodile!
