Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.29,0:02:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You peasants can call\Nme whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.85,0:03:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you, you pirates should\Nhave stayed out of this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.35,0:03:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're gonna pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.69,0:03:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.17,0:03:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you're underestimating us a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna take us all on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.09,0:03:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are a lot Of us and only one of\Nyou that's right and you're just the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.57,0:03:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,government's little dog who do you think\NYou are acting like a hero are those
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.71,0:03:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who wish to live lie down now what an\Nidiot perfect for target Practice get
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.35,0:03:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy. Every last berry\Nin this town is hard. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.01,0:03:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.95,0:03:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but a pathetic puppet
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.91,0:03:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.81,0:04:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a puppet, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.41,0:04:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so, idiot pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.51,0:04:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.81,0:04:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's leaving now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.79,0:04:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile! Crocodile!\NCrocodile! Crocodile! Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.85,0:05:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.33,0:05:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killer -
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he beat us here again.
