Dialogue: 2,0:05:01.51,0:05:05.93,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(723,758)\fad(1410,0)\blur0.6\bord0.3\fscx89\fscy95\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&HF6F4F6&\3c&HF6F4F6&\1a&HFF&\4a&HFF&\t(0,1410,\1a&H00&)}Alubarna Palace\NKingdom of Arabasta
Dialogue: 3,0:05:01.51,0:05:05.93,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(723,758)\fad(1410,0)\blur0.6\bord0\fscx89\fscy95\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&HF6F4F6&\4a&HFF&\t(0,1410,1,\blur2.5)\3c&HFFFFFF&}Alubarna Palace\NKingdom of Arabasta
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.67,0:05:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like he is always one step ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.77,0:05:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the time we arrived, the pirates\Nhad already been taken care of. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, as long as the citizens are safe,\NI suppose there's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.65,0:05:18.65,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,765)\fad(0,1500)\blur0.6\bord4.5\fscx84.55\fscy95\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp7\c&H171717&\3c&H171717&\t(2500,4000,\1a&HFF&)}Nefertari Cobra\NKing of Arabasta
Dialogue: 2,0:05:14.65,0:05:18.65,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,765)\fad(0,1500)\blur0.6\bord0.3\fscx84.55\fscy95\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp7\3c&HFFFFFF&\4a&HFF&\t(2500,4000,\1a&HFF&)}Nefertari Cobra\NKing of Arabasta
Dialogue: 3,0:05:14.65,0:05:18.65,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,765)\fad(0,1500)\blur2\bord0\fscx84.55\fscy95\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp7\c&HF1F6F4&\4a&HFF&}Nefertari Cobra\NKing of Arabasta
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.05,0:05:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile has been a great help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.87,0:05:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.57,0:05:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.77,0:05:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've almost made it to Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.37,0:05:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lie to me, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.67,0:05:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you know right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.65,0:05:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.83,0:05:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to look me in the eyes\Nright now and tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.61,0:05:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No idea what you mean, Saji.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.57,0:05:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything. No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.61,0:05:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let me ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.67,0:05:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did enough food for eight people,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.37,0:05:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which I carefully divided up so that it\Nwould last until we reached Alabasta,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.33,0:05:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,suddenly go missing in\Nthe middle of the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.51,0:05:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lying is pointless, so\Njust tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.77,0:05:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a terrible poker face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.91,0:06:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, it looks like you have\Nsomething around your mouth there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.09,0:06:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot about the crumbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.83,0:06:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.51,0:06:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.07,0:06:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami, we need to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.71,0:06:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need a better way of keeping\Nthe food safe from Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.49,0:06:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we please buy a\Nrefrigerator that locks?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.35,0:06:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.49,0:06:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might be a good idea, since it\Ncould be a matter of life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.35,0:06:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we really do need to\Ncatch something for Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.15,0:06:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, how's the fishing going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.45,0:06:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, it's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.41,0:06:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take my eyes off anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.51,0:07:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.89,0:07:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the fish aren't biting at all? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.77,0:07:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do realize this is your fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.39,0:07:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ate all the bait that we had.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.75,0:07:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fish aren't ever going to bite\Nif we don't give them a reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.29,0:07:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ate some too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.43,0:07:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I only ate a little bit\Njust what was stuck to the lid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.01,0:07:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, so how's it\Ngoing catch anything yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.83,0:07:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think we could catch a shark?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.97,0:07:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I really want to catch a\Nsea king Stop fishing with my duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.81,0:07:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.13,0:07:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.43,0:07:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.35,0:07:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cotton candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.83,0:07:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.09,0:08:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go get Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.93,0:08:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, there's something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.27,0:08:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.07,0:08:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.87,0:08:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.93,0:08:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a little steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.09,0:08:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying that steam's\Ncoming up out of the ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.45,0:08:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.36,0:08:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hot spot, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.28,0:08:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a hot spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.41,0:08:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An area of the sea where magma's made.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.73,0:08:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Below the steam over there\Nis an undersea volcano.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.51,0:08:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are volcanoes underneath\Nthe sea? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.05,0:08:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, there are actually more volcanoes\Nunder the sea than there are on dry land.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.91,0:08:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.21,0:08:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I guess we can't eat\Nthe steam then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.57,0:08:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There will be a brand new island\Nover there, thanks to the volcano.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.67,0:08:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the process will take\Ntens of thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.57,0:08:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.71,0:08:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.29,0:08:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wonder if I can live that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.03,0:08:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd plan on dying sometime before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.79,0:08:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you caught anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.13,0:08:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.89,0:08:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you cook us something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.05,0:09:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are just hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.45,0:09:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll go search the storage area\Nanyway to see if we have anything left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.93,0:09:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.84,0:09:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It smells like sulfur!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.89,0:09:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.43,0:09:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's steam everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.35,0:09:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disappear with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.26,0:09:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be out of the steam soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.17,0:09:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Mr. Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.05,0:09:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.99,0:09:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a whole bunch\Nof smoke at 12 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.17,0:09:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of some smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.95,0:09:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.41,0:09:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what, we've\Ngot to take care of Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.69,0:09:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, or else the next\Ntarget's going to be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.77,0:09:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.53,0:09:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.11,0:09:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.33,0:09:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.93,0:09:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.41,0:10:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two has completely disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.17,0:10:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's check the cabin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.71,0:10:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't find him! This is\NMr. Two! Where did you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.85,0:10:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.09,0:10:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is getting out of hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of these days I need to stop\Njumping on every random duck I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.23,0:10:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.27,0:10:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.47,0:10:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get me out of here, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.07,0:10:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.35,0:10:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was going to\Ndie there for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.87,0:10:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.78,0:10:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved me! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.23,0:10:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never imagined my life would be\Nsaved by a group of complete strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.95,0:10:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.55,0:10:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.21,0:10:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, could I trouble\Nyou for a cup of warm soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.77,0:11:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A chicken noodle will do. No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.09,0:11:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't even feed ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.29,0:11:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.51,0:11:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just an absolute cutie,\Naren't you? Oh, yeah. Sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.73,0:11:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.85,0:11:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, you really can't swim, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.39,0:11:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.30,0:11:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I ate a Devil Fruit, so\NI can't swim even a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.21,0:11:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.12,0:11:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.57,0:11:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.55,0:11:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, since I can't go anywhere\Nuntil my ship picks me up,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.41,0:11:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no harm in a little fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.07,0:11:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For saving my life, I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.31,0:11:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.69,0:11:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.35,0:11:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.33,0:11:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.57,0:11:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all just for a\Nlittle fun, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.03,0:11:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey now, mean guy. Relax. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.89,0:11:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.35,0:11:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I touch my face\Nwith my left hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.17,0:11:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.69,0:12:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that is the power of the\Nclone clone Devil Fruit, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.19,0:12:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.37,0:12:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The body and the voice match perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.37,0:12:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.28,0:12:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But honestly, I didn't really\Nhave to slap you around like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.23,0:12:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.19,0:12:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.10,0:12:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is touch\Nmy right hand to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.17,0:12:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see, I can mimic anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.89,0:12:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.11,0:12:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can change bodies, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.63,0:12:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.75,0:12:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Guy, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.13,0:12:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm terribly sorry, but I\Nshouldn't demonstrate my power anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.37,0:12:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Please! No more!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.15,0:12:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.37,0:12:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you absolutely insist, I\Nguess I can show a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.31,0:12:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, that's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.63,0:12:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's really hamming it up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.37,0:12:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, I have\Nsomething even more incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.41,0:12:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm equipped with a memory feature.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.15,0:12:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.41,0:12:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.93,0:13:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.77,0:13:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And twirl open blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.21,0:13:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, did everyone enjoy my\Nvery special secret talent?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.99,0:13:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's quite impressive, but\NI almost never show it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.45,0:13:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.57,0:13:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too good to be true!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.59,0:13:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too good to be true! Oh, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.09,0:13:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too good to be true!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.11,0:13:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.02,0:13:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too good to be true!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.09,0:13:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's already time to say\Ngoodbye. What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.83,0:13:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No you can't leave please\Ndon't go try not to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.53,0:13:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be sad journeys must\Nalways include farewells.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.09,0:13:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet i will never\Nforget you or today it's
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.73,0:14:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Been brief, but true friendship\Nisn't determined by time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.81,0:14:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.51,0:14:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you, Kozan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.75,0:14:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, quickly, let's be going! Yes,\Nsir, Mr. Two, Mr. Barclay, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.41,0:14:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.93,0:14:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy is Mr. Two?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.99,0:14:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, you mean you didn't\Nknow him just by looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.65,0:14:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh, I've never met Mr. Two or Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.07,0:14:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One and his partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.98,0:14:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know much about any of\Nthem, or what their powers may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.91,0:14:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I have heard rumors about them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.61,0:14:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard about Mr. 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.49,0:14:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, he's a very tall\Nballerina who talks like a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.17,0:14:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he always wears a swan coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.99,0:14:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The coat says Bon Clay on the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.71,0:14:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.17,0:14:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, Vivi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.13,0:14:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw something in his memory,\Nin the faces that he showed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.29,0:15:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of those faces belonged to my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.03,0:15:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cobra Nefertari, my father,\Nthe king of Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.75,0:15:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.79,0:15:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can mimic the face\Nof a king that easily, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.51,0:15:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two has the potential to\Ncause a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.07,0:15:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we let a really\Nbad guy get away today, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.37,0:15:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that guy is our enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.37,0:15:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems so, and having him on the\Nother side is not a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.81,0:15:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.73,0:15:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two realizes that we're the\Nones Baroque Works is after,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.41,0:15:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then he can use the memories he got\Nearlier to transform into any one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.95,0:15:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't even be able to\Ntrust our own friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.19,0:15:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.77,0:15:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll explain it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.21,0:15:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.93,0:15:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's slow, but he's\Nright not to be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.97,0:15:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hear me out on this one,\Nand I think you'll agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.19,0:15:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's actually a good\Nthing that we ran into Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.41,0:15:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two when we did, because now we can prepare,\Nand we can beat him at his own game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.25,0:15:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure seem to be in a particularly\Ngood mood for some reason, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.83,0:16:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.74,0:16:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you say four again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.75,0:16:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just so happens I made\Nsome new friends today.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.89,0:16:15.47,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(720,217)\fad(420,0)\blur0.6\bord4.5\fscx71\fscy86\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(0,420,\1a&H00&)}{Viz TL}Sea Cat (Sea Monster)\NTerritory: The Coast of {the?}Sandy Island
Dialogue: 2,0:16:12.89,0:16:15.47,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(720,217)\fad(420,0)\blur0.6\bord0.7\fscx71\fscy86\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\3c&HFFFFFF&\4a&HFF&\1a&HFF&\t(0,420,\1a&H00&)}Sea Cat (Sea Monster)\NTerritory: The Coast of Sandy Island
Dialogue: 3,0:16:12.89,0:16:15.47,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(720,217)\fad(420,0)\blur0.6\bord0\fscx71\fscy86\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\4a&HFF&}{Viz TL}Sea Cat (Sea Monster)\NTerritory: The Coast of {the?}Sandy Island
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.45,0:16:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.73,0:16:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sea cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.99,0:16:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a sea cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.65,0:16:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like food to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.47,0:16:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.65,0:16:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're on the right track.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.89,0:16:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if we can just get\Nthere alive, that'd be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.93,0:16:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Food for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.21,0:16:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's breaking away! Reverse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.55,0:16:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put the boat in reverse! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.63,0:16:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.01,0:16:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let it get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.07,0:16:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the two of you don't\Ncapture it, I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.91,0:16:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, sea kitten, how do\Nyou think I should cook you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.77,0:16:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eevee, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.03,0:17:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry! Why? Just why? It was food!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.91,0:17:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you can't eat a sea cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.75,0:17:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.15,0:17:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sea cats are sacred animals in Alabasta!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.43,0:17:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.73,0:17:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are more animals in\Nthe ocean than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.49,0:17:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're still scared of that stuff,\Nthen you have a long way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.49,0:17:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.40,0:17:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let me tell you about\Nthe time that I, Usopp,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.69,0:17:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Single-handedly fought off the sea\Nkings of the Calm Belt, young Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sea kings? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.03,0:17:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And big ones, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.55,0:17:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, they were really huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.99,0:17:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our food got away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.75,0:17:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but don't worry, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.59,0:17:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be able to stuff\Nyourself full really soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.17,0:17:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.49,0:17:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will we get another cat to eat, Vivi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.23,0:17:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, the wind and weather\Nseem to be stabilizing. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.21,0:17:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're entering the\Nclimate area of Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.27,0:17:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing a seat cat come out of\Nthe water is proof as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.05,0:17:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And those things you\Nsee behind us over there
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.95,0:17:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are all the proof I need\Nthat we're getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.95,0:18:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a lot of ships huh\Nare they they're all
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.93,0:18:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,flying the baroque works\Nsymbol on their mast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.07,0:18:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be good it looks as if all the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.91,0:18:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,baroque works employees\Nhave started gathering.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.85,0:18:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing that these\Nare the billions they're
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.43,0:18:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the subordinates under\Nthe officer agents which
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.21,0:18:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Means that there are at\Nleast 200 enemies waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.51,0:18:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for us the best the\Nbaroque works has to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.91,0:18:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The elite of the\Nunderlings this group will
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.69,0:18:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,surely be a lot better\Nthan the bounty hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.51,0:18:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At whiskey peak come on
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.57,0:18:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's blow them all away
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.67,0:18:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll be quicker if we\Njust go over there and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.77,0:18:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beat Them up hold on though\Ni need to eat something
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.77,0:18:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,first come on they're not\Nworth it don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.33,0:18:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.31,0:18:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to keep our eyes on the prize\Nor we might lose this all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.25,0:18:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, eight against\Ntwo hundred sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.59,0:18:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just make sure and try it tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.55,0:19:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want anyone fooled\Nby the enemy's disguises.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.49,0:19:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.63,0:19:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll always know who our friends are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.43,0:19:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look for the bandage on their arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.49,0:19:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This clone clone fruit guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.51,0:19:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, is he that similar when\Nhe turns into someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.15,0:19:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.37,0:19:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the same, not just similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.05,0:19:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was crazy. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.11,0:19:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have seen it, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.51,0:19:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He changed into every\None of us, even Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.49,0:19:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then we got to dance with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know that someone with his\Npowers is among the enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.57,0:19:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we need to be really careful\Nto be on our guard at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.21,0:19:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what should I do to\Nhelp against this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.97,0:19:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just do whatever it is you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.75,0:19:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not expected to do\Nanything more, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.85,0:19:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you get overwhelmed, then just run.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.73,0:19:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like the pep talk\Nhe's always giving himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.71,0:19:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.25,0:19:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.61,0:19:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see the island now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.97,0:19:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's stop at the town called Nanohana.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.05,0:19:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to hide the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.69,0:19:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, no matter what happens on that island,\Nremember, this thing on all our arms?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.99,0:19:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is a sign of our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.03,0:20:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's land, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.55,0:20:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.83,0:20:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and help me to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.59,0:20:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a side note.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.29,0:20:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now remember, our enemy is\Na whole gang of assassins?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.55,0:20:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.89,0:20:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is just try to think before\Nyou do anything stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.21,0:20:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.13,0:20:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course. You're right.\NI got it. Really. I will.

